<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Snowball</h1>
<p>Sphere: Frost Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 6)
Mana: 12
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast snowball &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast snowball</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The caster's body shakes with the words 'Bolat snellok', and the moisture 
in the air forms a ball of snow that is hurled at the target. It is the 
first and weakest of the frost spells: the better your magic and your 
frost sphere, the more it chills. Unlike most attacks, it hits harder 
the heavier the armour: it does best of all against plate. A shield can 
block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while fighting, 
and no free hands are needed. It is also found on wands, staffs and 
scrolls.
</p><p><br />
